          {
            "sha": "f0d3ac96054d747023b8dde808a813d255013372",
            "filename": "openspec/changes/disable-dashboard-browser-translation/proposal.md",
            "status": "added",
            "additions": 14,
            "deletions": 0,
            "changes": 14,
            "blob_url": "https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/blob/58f429774c1e28bc1f986d04b8774871884d8c7a/openspec%2Fchanges%2Fdisable-dashboard-browser-translation%2Fproposal.md",
            "raw_url": "https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/raw/58f429774c1e28bc1f986d04b8774871884d8c7a/openspec%2Fchanges%2Fdisable-dashboard-browser-translation%2Fproposal.md",
            "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Soju06/codex-lb/contents/openspec%2Fchanges%2Fdisable-dashboard-browser-translation%2Fproposal.md?ref=58f429774c1e28bc1f986d04b8774871884d8c7a",
            "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@\n+## Why\n+\n+Chrome's built-in Translate action and the Google Translate extension can mutate React-owned dashboard text nodes by injecting translation markup. That conflicts with React reconciliation and can freeze the SPA.\n+\n+## What Changes\n+\n+- Mark the dashboard HTML document, body, and React root as non-translatable.\n+- Add Google's `notranslate` meta tag so browser translation tools do not rewrite dashboard DOM text nodes.\n+\n+## Impact\n+\n+- Prevents browser translation from modifying the live React dashboard DOM.\n+- Keeps the dashboard usable for operators affected by Google Translate injection.\n+- Does not add built-in localization; a first-party i18n UI remains a separate feature."
          },
          {
            "sha": "1dfc08d112b3fc2b622d71958b26fa1cf35e74d8",
            "filename": "openspec/changes/disable-dashboard-browser-translation/specs/frontend-architecture/spec.md",
            "status": "added",
            "additions": 11,
            "deletions": 0,
            "changes": 11,
            "blob_url": "https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/blob/58f429774c1e28bc1f986d04b8774871884d8c7a/openspec%2Fchanges%2Fdisable-dashboard-browser-translation%2Fspecs%2Ffrontend-architecture%2Fspec.md",
            "raw_url": "https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/raw/58f429774c1e28bc1f986d04b8774871884d8c7a/openspec%2Fchanges%2Fdisable-dashboard-browser-translation%2Fspecs%2Ffrontend-architecture%2Fspec.md",
            "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Soju06/codex-lb/contents/openspec%2Fchanges%2Fdisable-dashboard-browser-translation%2Fspecs%2Ffrontend-architecture%2Fspec.md?ref=58f429774c1e28bc1f986d04b8774871884d8c7a",
            "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+## MODIFIED Requirements\n+\n+### Requirement: Dashboard HTML shell avoids browser translation DOM mutation\n+\n+The dashboard HTML shell SHALL opt out of browser/extension translation for the React-owned document surface so external translation tools do not inject markup into React-managed text nodes.\n+\n+#### Scenario: Dashboard opts out of Google Translate DOM rewriting\n+\n+- **WHEN** the browser loads the dashboard HTML shell\n+- **THEN** the document advertises `notranslate` metadata for Google Translate\n+- **AND** the document, body, and React root are marked with `translate=\"no\"`"
          },
          {
            "sha": "35ab264e11422883ae337b4e2ea5fd649f103224",
            "filename": "openspec/changes/disable-dashboard-browser-translation/tasks.md",
            "status": "added",
            "additions": 10,
            "deletions": 0,
            "changes": 10,
            "blob_url": "https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/blob/58f429774c1e28bc1f986d04b8774871884d8c7a/openspec%2Fchanges%2Fdisable-dashboard-browser-translation%2Ftasks.md",
            "raw_url": "https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/raw/58f429774c1e28bc1f986d04b8774871884d8c7a/openspec%2Fchanges%2Fdisable-dashboard-browser-translation%2Ftasks.md",
            "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Soju06/codex-lb/contents/openspec%2Fchanges%2Fdisable-dashboard-browser-translation%2Ftasks.md?ref=58f429774c1e28bc1f986d04b8774871884d8c7a",
            "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@\n+## 1. Dashboard HTML\n+\n+- [x] 1.1 Add document-level `translate=\"no\"` to the dashboard HTML shell.\n+- [x] 1.2 Add Google `notranslate` metadata.\n+- [x] 1.3 Add `translate=\"no\"` to the React root container.\n+\n+## 2. Validation\n+\n+- [x] 2.1 Run the frontend production build.\n+- [x] 2.2 Run OpenSpec validation for this change."
          }
        ]
